  "body": "Privately elevated on one of Takapuna’s most coveted seaward-side streets, this exceptional cedar residence brings together considered architecture, refined interiors and an extraordinary connection to the sea.\r\n\r\nCommanding sweeping views across the Hauraki Gulf, the home occupies a privileged position between Milford and Thorne Bay beaches, with the shoreline moments away and pedestrian access to Kitchener Road connecting effortlessly to both Takapuna and Milford villages.\r\n\r\nComprehensively transformed with a strong architectural sensibility, the residence has been reimagined as a sophisticated coastal sanctuary. Striking cedar exteriors, beautifully landscaped grounds and extensive outdoor living establish a sense of understated elegance from the outset.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is designed for relaxed living and effortless entertaining. An exceptional designer kitchen features premium Miele appliances, stone surfaces and a generous separate butler’s kitchen, while adjoining living and dining spaces embrace the spectacular sea outlook.\r\n\r\nA separate media room, second lounge or additional bedroom opens to a covered Louvre-roof terrace, beautifully positioned to capture the afternoon sun. The elegant principal lounge connects seamlessly with extensive wraparound decking, while a study nook, separate laundry and guest powder room complete the level.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the master suite is a private retreat with sea views, a luxurious ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Two further double bedrooms provide generous accommodation, with one incorporating its own sitting area and sea views, creating an adaptable retreat for teenagers, guests or extended family. A beautifully appointed bathroom completes this level.\r\n\r\nThe bedrooms open directly onto a substantial deck and landscaped garden, continuing the home’s effortless relationship with its coastal surroundings.\r\n\r\nArchitectural in its sensibility, sophisticated yet deeply liveable, this is a home of rare balance. Its panoramic outlook, considered design and coveted position present an exceptional opportunity within one of Takapuna’s most tightly held coastal enclaves.\r\n\r\nA distinctive home. An extraordinary setting. Coastal living, elevated.\r\n\r\nContact Natalie Newton at New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.\r\n\r\nAIP Disclaimer\r\nImportant:  This property may be marketed as suitable for overseas purchasers. However, this does not constitute confirmation of eligibility, approval, or suitability for any individual buyer. All overseas purchasers remain subject to New Zealand’s overseas investment laws, including the Overseas Investment Act 2005, and may require consent from the Overseas Investment Office. You must obtain your own independent legal, financial, and technical advice and secure any necessary approvals before proceeding with a purchase.",
